    "headline": "Resurs Bank partners with Synerity to bring AI-powered support to Nordic customers",
    "deck": "In just four months, Resurs Bank successfully rolled out Zendesk across all Nordic markets, creating one unified platform for customer care. Together with Synerity, a strong foundation was built for a more digital, data-driven, and AI-enabled customer experience, with continued focus on automation and smarter ways of working.",
    "byline": null,
    "meta": [
      "Markets",
      "Zendesk customer since",
      "Industry"
    ],
    "lead-image": {
      "src": "https://d1eipm3vz40hy0.cloudfront.net/images/Customer+Stories+/Resurs+Bank/resurs_rgb_black.png",
      "alt": "",
      "w": 1706
    },
    "body": {
      "sectionHeadings": [
        "Using AI to resolve more customer questions",
        "A more connected, data-led operation",
        "Working as one team with Synerity",
        "Looking ahead"
      ],
      "paragraphs": 16
    },
    "pullquotes": [
      "“A Swedish colleague can support a Finnish customer, and vice versa.”",
      "“Now when we can present fact-based data—our voice is really powerful.”",
      "“We were up and running in four months,” says Pernilla Klarqvist, Head of Customer Care at Resurs. “We now have 56 percent of our customers on a digital channel. We have a unified work system. We have the data.”",
      "“A Swedish colleague can support a Finnish customer, and vice versa. That flexibility across our Nordic markets is a major step forward for us.”",
      "“Now when we can present fact-based data—our voice is really powerful,” Pernilla says.",
      "“We wouldn’t be where we are today without that help,” Pernilla says.",
      "“We’re slowly entering a governance phase, taking care of existing users while heavily evolving the system at the same time,” Jesper Zachrisson says."
    ],
